{"date":"2014-10-17","platform":"剧场版","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/89/54/117645_Nw3n4.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/89/54/117645_Nw3n4.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/89/54/117645_Nw3n4.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/89/54/117645_Nw3n4.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/89/54/117645_Nw3n4.jpg"},"summary":"片中，男主角马诺洛（墨西哥演员迭戈·鲁纳配音），要击败情敌华金（查宁·塔图姆配音），赢得爱人玛利亚（佐伊·索尔达娜）的芳心。为此，他不但必须在剑术上胜过马诺洛，以及击剑高手玛利亚本人，还得穿越“铭记之地”（The Land of the Remembered），抵挡种种诱惑，重回人间。 \r\n　　影片瑰丽斑斓，色彩丰富，充满墨西哥文化元素。墨西哥人认为，死亡是生命的归宿，也是新生的开始。每年11月的前两天为传统节日“鬼节”（Dia de Muertos），全国都要隆重庆祝，带着面具到处游玩，面包和糖果都装饰着骷髅的形象。片中“铭记之地”的色彩、乐器乃至食物，以及马诺洛的骷髅造型，都从“鬼节”的传统习俗中汲取灵感。","name":"The Book of Life","name_cn":"生命之书","tags":[{"name":"欧美","count":37,"total_count":86970},{"name":"剧场版","count":35,"total_count":726317},{"name":"墨西哥","count":25,"total_count":44},{"name":"奇幻","count":18,"total_count":473443},{"name":"2014","count":16,"total_count":71338},{"name":"搞笑","count":11,"total_count":640695},{"name":"美国","count":11,"total_count":27208},{"name":"20世纪福克斯","count":11,"total_count":24},{"name":"恋爱","count":11,"total_count":566269},{"name":"动画电影","count":8,"total_count":43981},{"name":"亡灵之日","count":8,"total_count":8},{"name":"乐高玩具","count":4,"total_count":4},{"name":"非日本动画","count":3,"total_count":59},{"name":"头重脚轻","count":3,"total_count":3},{"name":"2男1女","count":2,"total_count":2},{"name":"原创","count":2,"total_count":622074},{"name":"20thCenturyStudios","count":1,"total_count":1},{"name":"JorgeR.Gutierrez","count":1,"total_count":1},{"name":"待看","count":1,"total_count":526},{"name":"2014年10月","count":1,"total_count":29729},{"name":"偶片","count":1,"total_count":14},{"name":"非日漫","count":1,"total_count":291},{"name":"Reel_FX","count":1,"total_count":1},{"name":"动画","count":1,"total_count":35757},{"name":"乐高","count":1,"total_count":263},{"name":"音乐","count":1,"total_count":103295},{"name":"电影","count":1,"total_count":13620},{"nam